  <content>
  <section><title> Activity </title>
<para>A child gets on a swing in a playground, swings for 30 seconds, and then gets off the swing.</para>
<para><figure><media alt="A girl on a swing. "><image mime-type="image/png" src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/bc837af9aa5dab30f8a5f535195cc04f8c38e69d"/></media></figure></para>
<para>In the following activity, you will be provided with descriptions of four functions and four graphs representing them. The independent variable in each function is time, measured in seconds. </para>
<div class="os-raise-usermessage-link">
    <para>Log into <link url="https://student.desmos.com">student.desmos.com</link> using the information provided by your teacher to complete the activity.</para>
  </div></section>
</content>
